  )
  (text "STM32G031K8T6:\n- ADC: CELL_B1..B4 (tap x1/6), NTC_BAT, VOUT_SENSE, CELL_SENSE.\n- I2C1 PB6/PB7 100kHz: BQ25713 (0x6B), TPS65988 (I2C1).\n- CHG_EN / DSG_EN: FET proteksi baterai (default OFF).\n- BB_EN + BB_ADJ (PA7 = TIM3_CH2 PWM): output XL4005.\n- SW501 VOUT 4 bit (16 preset) + SW502 APPLY.\n- Firmware: OV/UV per cell, suhu, gauge dari ADC BQ25713." (at 271.78 187.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "172f101b-fae7-55e6-91e9-a7f53deeaa2f")
  )
)
